:away:sub}."],"impact":"L'homme du match selon nos craies : Son Heung-Min (1 but, 0,39 xG, 0,34 xT)."},"en":{"lead":"{T:away:sub} win 2–1. A deserved win: 1.88 xG to 0.82, the scoreboard told the truth.","keys":["Big chances (xG ≥ 0.30): 0 for {T:home:sub}, 1 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"Man of the match, by our chalk: Son Heung-Min (1 goal, 0.39 xG, 0.34 xT)."}},"s2":{"fr":{"lead":"{T:home:Sub} annonçait un 4-3-3 et a attaqué en 3-3-4 : la composition d'équipe, c'est un point de départ, pas un contrat. Sur la feuille, {T:away:sub} était en 4-2-3-1. Sur le terrain, avec le ballon, ça ressemblait plutôt à un 4-4-2.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} change de peau selon la phase : 3-3-4 avec le ballon, 4-5-1 sans.","{T:away:Sub} change de peau selon la phase : 4-4-2 avec le ballon, 3-3-4 sans.","{T:home:Sub} a joué large : 52 % des touches dans les deux couloirs extérieurs.","{T:home:Sub} a passé du temps chez l'adversaire : 32 % de ses touches dans le dernier tiers.","Le couloir préféré {T:away:de} : le couloir droit (24 % des touches)."],"impact":"Le plan {T:away:de} a tenu jusqu'au bout. Les positions moyennes ne disent pas tout, mais elles disent qui occupait le terrain."},"en":{"lead":"{T:home:sub} announced a 4-3-3 and attacked in a 3-3-4: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract. On paper, {T:away:sub} lined up in a 4-2-3-1. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 4-4-2.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-3-4 with the ball, 4-5-1 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 4-4-2 with the ball, 3-3-4 without.","{T:home:sub} played wide: 52% of touches in the two outer lanes.","{T:home:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 32% of touches in the final third.","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the right wing (24% of touches)."],"impact":"{T:away:pos} plan held to the end. Average positions do not say everything, but they say who owned the space."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:away:sub} : un PPDA de 10,6, contre 14,5 en face. Com